      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "GOOD OLD FASHION ADVICE ,PRESENTATION AND SERVICE .... what a pleasure it has been and will be to deal with Steve Torpy and his amazing team. MY daughter recently had a full solar and battery system installed .We was so impressed that I  have had COASTAL SOLAR  now install a 9.1 kw solar system at my residence. The whole experience at both installations has been fantastic ,from the initial inquiries to the end result .The whole team at COASTAL SOLAR  are to ce commended on their professionalism. and expertise..... highly recommend that you look no further than COSTAL SOLAR if you are considering installing solar.....once the government sort out  the domestic battery  rebates, my first call will be to COASTAL SOLAR........",
