      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "After receiving numerous quotes, and an unbelievable high prices for a 6.6kW system (door knocker), I was ready to go with a mob off SolarQuotes, who was offering a 13.2kW system at a very keen price.At that time an radio ad came on a local radio station for CSS, and I thought I'd have a chat with one last company before making my decision.  Steve was very friendly, knowledgeable and polite, and he actually bettered the quote I was planning on going with.In my ratings, I've opted to only offer a 4/5 for the quality of the system, as our system was only installed 2 days ago, so it's too early to offer anything different.Regarding the installation, I received a phone call the day before installation to ensure everything was good to go, and the young team of Jackson, Jack and Xavier arrived on time on the day of installation - and they were all polite, well mannered and fully professional.They tidied up as they went, and Jackson sorted out a minor set up glitch with an online support team before he left - to ensure the system was working perfectly.They installed 30 panels on our roof, as well as installing all the electricals - in just over 8 hours (which was the estimated time suggested).I would strongly recommend Coastal Solar Solutions - efficient, polite, well mannered and all at a good price.",
