      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Very refreshing. Finally, a business that provided best practice. Steve (Central Coast Solar) was one of 3 businesses that made contact following an on-line enquiry, but the only one to take the time to meet on-site and listen to our needs. He was on-time, a quick quoting process, patient to listen to questions and ultimately met (or above) our expectations.After a lot of research and qualifying the proposed system, Steve was the obvious first choice for installation with a competitive price, but it was the support and communication that convinced us. His business approach gained our trust and confidence.The trust and confidence gained were backed up with action. The installation was on time, seamless and tidy. A professional outfit (thankyou to the team). I note we are located in Lake Macquarie and Steve still managed to be available for quoting, and on time for the install.Just remember, a good business will be in demand and you need to be active in that process. Steve is busy dealing with real customers and tries very hard to meet all demands and balance his projects, customers and suppliers. Your courteous and patient contact will be rewarded with a good outcome. Very happy with the final product (4 x tesla powerwalls with gateway and backup). Thankyou.",
